{
  "env": "dev",
  "account_id": "f011d0ee02b23cad26b4b38151b204ad",
  "zone": "yonedarepo.com",
  "workers_subdomain": "mlong-f01",
  "prefix": "yonedarepo-staging",
  "ref": "dev",
  "secrets_file": "~/.config/yonedarepo/staging.env",
  "vars": {
    "origin": "https://dev.yonedarepo.com",
    "ratelimit": "2001"
  },
  "check_instances": 4,
  "workers": [
    {
      "role": "superfan",
      "file": "wrangler.staging-superfan.jsonc",
      "notes": [
        "Staging superfan: the same cheap-model watcher as wrangler.superfan.jsonc, pointed at the",
        "staging platform Worker (yonedarepo-staging-platform, dev.yonedarepo.com stack) with its own",
        "ledger and a $1/day cap. Secrets, set from stdin:",
        "CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN  API token with Account > Account Analytics > Read only",
        "SUPERFAN_READ_TOKEN bearer for GET /findings, GET /status, POST /run",
        "Deployed first: the staging platform names this Worker in tail_consumers."
      ],
      "secrets": [
        "CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN",
        "SUPERFAN_READ_TOKEN"
      ],
      "ephemeral": false,
      "config": {
        "name": "{prefix}-superfan",
        "main": "superfan/index.ts",
        "compatibility_date": "2026-10-07",
        "workers_dev": true,
        "preview_urls": false,
        "observability": {
          "enabled": true
        },
        "triggers": {
          "crons": [
            "7 * * * *"
          ]
        },
        "vars": {
          "CF_ACCOUNT_ID": "{account_id}",
          "WATCH_SCRIPT": "{prefix}-platform",
          "WATCH_URL": "https://{prefix}-platform.{subdomain}.workers.dev",
          "NS_SOURCE_REPOSITORY": "79b971142019457fa1b44173f66dabb3",
          "NS_OBJECT_PUSH_QUEUE": "77956798d14745adba68db4fb023b7d0",
          "NS_CHECK_CONTAINER": "2f18b1ca51674599b1dd25c7be2c0862",
          "QUEUE_JOBS_ID": "c57628b785814cfc9dc2403eb06071cc",
          "QUEUE_DEAD_LETTER_ID": "4825c46a19af484f968bba559c9d2a16",
          "CHECK_CONTAINER_APP_ID": "a0306118-835b-440b-be9c-431a68ca1453",
          "TELEMETRY_SOURCE": "cloudflare",
          "SUPERFAN_MODEL": "mimo-v2.6-flash",
          "MIMO_TOKEN_PLAN_REGION": "sgp",
          "DAILY_CAP_MICROUSD": "1000000"
        },
        "secrets_store_secrets": [
          {
            "binding": "MIMO_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "MiMo"
          },
          {
            "binding": "ZAI_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "ZAI"
          }
        ],
        "durable_objects": {
          "bindings": [
            {
              "name": "LEDGER",
              "class_name": "SuperfanLedger"
            }
          ]
        },
        "migrations": [
          {
            "tag": "v1",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "SuperfanLedger"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "platform",
      "file": "wrangler.staging-platform.jsonc",
      "notes": [
        "Staging platform Worker (dev.yonedarepo.com stack): the same source platform as",
        "wrangler.platform.jsonc, with its own Durable Object namespaces, Artifacts namespace, R2,",
        "D1, queues, workflow, check containers and secrets, so it shares nothing with production",
        "(yonedarepo-dev) or platform-dev. Browsers reach it through the staging agent Worker's",
        "/api/v1 proxy (PLATFORM service binding); workers.dev stays on for direct API benches.",
        "Keep this file in step with wrangler.platform.jsonc. Secrets, set from stdin:",
        "OWNER_TOKEN  staging-only owner credential (~/.config/yonedarepo/staging.env)",
        "VAULT_KEY    64 hex characters, shared with yonedarepo-staging-agents",
        "Run next to the data: a commit makes about ten round trips to its repository's",
        "Durable Object, R2 (ENAM) and Artifacts, so each costs a hop to the client's colo",
        "otherwise. New repository objects are created near the placed Worker.",
        "The staging superfan (wrangler.staging-superfan.jsonc) receives this Worker's tail",
        "events: outcomes, logs, exceptions and CPU/wall time, with no API token.",
        "Batched landing, with commits beginning from and main reads served by the published",
        "head. No LAND_MODE_OVERRIDE: per-request mode headers are for platform-dev benches only.",
        "Check runs take minutes (container start, the check): one per invocation, up to",
        "the container limit (4) at once, apart from the derive and projection jobs above.",
        "api.dev.yonedarepo.com is the platform API's own hostname (Custom Domain plus the exact route, which wins over the apps Worker's *.yonedarepo.com route); WEB_ORIGIN is where people approve device logins (/device).",
        "Model checks call the review model with REVIEW_MODEL_KEY, the managed Z.ai key (Secrets Store secret ZAI, the same store key the agent Worker's managed connections use), bound to the platform Worker itself; it never reads an agent-layer connection."
      ],
      "secrets": [
        "OWNER_TOKEN",
        "VAULT_KEY"
      ],
      "health": "yonedarepo-platform",
      "config": {
        "name": "{prefix}-platform",
        "main": "worker/platform-index.ts",
        "compatibility_date": "2026-10-07",
        "compatibility_flags": [
          "nodejs_compat"
        ],
        "limits": {
          "subrequests": 50000
        },
        "workers_dev": true,
        "preview_urls": false,
        "observability": {
          "enabled": true
        },
        "placement": {
          "mode": "targeted",
          "region": "aws:us-east-1"
        },
        "tail_consumers": [
          {
            "service": "{prefix}-superfan"
          }
        ],
        "assets": {
          "directory": "../frontend/dist",
          "binding": "ASSETS",
          "not_found_handling": "single-page-application",
          "run_worker_first": true
        },
        "vars": {
          "ARTIFACTS_NAMESPACE": "{prefix}",
          "LAND_MODE": "batch",
          "WEB_ORIGIN": "{origin}"
        },
        "secrets_store_secrets": [
          {
            "binding": "REVIEW_MODEL_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "ZAI"
          }
        ],
        "artifacts": [
          {
            "binding": "ARTIFACTS",
            "namespace": "{prefix}",
            "remote": true
          }
        ],
        "durable_objects": {
          "bindings": [
            {
              "name": "WORKSPACES",
              "class_name": "WorkspaceAuthority"
            },
            {
              "name": "SOURCE_REPOS",
              "class_name": "SourceRepository"
            },
            {
              "name": "CHECK_RUNNERS",
              "class_name": "CheckContainer"
            },
            {
              "name": "OBJECT_PUSHES",
              "class_name": "ObjectPushQueue"
            },
            {
              "name": "COMMIT_SHARDS",
              "class_name": "CommitShard"
            },
            {
              "name": "LAND_COMBINERS",
              "class_name": "LandCombiner"
            }
          ]
        },
        "migrations": [
          {
            "tag": "v1",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "SourceRepository",
              "WorkspaceAuthority",
              "CheckContainer"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v2",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "ObjectPushQueue"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v3",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "CommitShard"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v4",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "LandCombiner"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "containers": [
          {
            "class_name": "CheckContainer",
            "image": "./containers/Dockerfile",
            "image_build_context": "..",
            "instance_type": "standard-1",
            "rollout_step_percentage": [
              100
            ],
            "constraints": {
              "regions": [
                "ENAM"
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "r2_buckets": [
          {
            "binding": "OBJECTS",
            "bucket_name": "{prefix}-platform-objects"
          }
        ],
        "d1_databases": [
          {
            "binding": "INDEX",
            "database_name": "{prefix}-platform-index",
            "migrations_dir": "migrations"
          }
        ],
        "queues": {
          "producers": [
            {
              "binding": "PLATFORM_QUEUE",
              "queue": "{prefix}-platform-jobs"
            },
            {
              "binding": "PLATFORM_CHECKS",
              "queue": "{prefix}-platform-checks"
            }
          ],
          "consumers": [
            {
              "queue": "{prefix}-platform-jobs",
              "max_batch_size": 10,
              "max_batch_timeout": 1,
              "max_concurrency": 20,
              "max_retries": 3,
              "dead_letter_queue": "{prefix}-platform-dead-letter"
            },
            {
              "queue": "{prefix}-platform-checks",
              "max_batch_size": 1,
              "max_retries": 3,
              "dead_letter_queue": "{prefix}-platform-dead-letter"
            }
          ]
        },
        "workflows": [
          {
            "name": "{prefix}-platform-import",
            "binding": "PLATFORM_IMPORT",
            "class_name": "PlatformImportWorkflow"
          }
        ],
        "ratelimits": [
          {
            "name": "AUTH_LIMITER",
            "namespace_id": "{ratelimit}",
            "simple": {
              "limit": 30,
              "period": 60
            }
          }
        ],
        "services": [
          {
            "binding": "SELF",
            "service": "{prefix}-platform"
          }
        ],
        "routes": [
          {
            "pattern": "api.dev.yonedarepo.com",
            "custom_domain": true
          },
          {
            "pattern": "https://api.dev.yonedarepo.com/*",
            "zone_name": "yonedarepo.com"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "agents",
      "file": "wrangler.staging-agents.jsonc",
      "notes": [
        "Staging agent-layer Worker: the front of the dev.yonedarepo.com stack (frontend, agent API,",
        "remote MCP). Same code as wrangler.agents.jsonc; it reaches only the staging platform, through",
        "the PLATFORM service binding (`/api/v1` is proxied there on the same origin) and the",
        "WORKSPACES script binding. Its stores, containers and secrets are its own. App previews are",
        "off: the apps Worker is bound to production, so APPS and APP_ORIGIN are unset here.",
        "Only the cheap providers have keys (ZAI glm-5.3-flash at low effort, MiMo mimo-v2.6-flash);",
        "Codex and Claude have no binding and fail closed with PROVIDER_MISSING. MANAGED_PROVIDER_KEYS",
        "lets the owner bind those two store keys to a named account as managed connections",
        "(POST /api/admin/providers/managed); no other config sets it, so production stays off.",
        "Spend: the owner workspace allowance is set to 5_000_000 microusd after deploy",
        "(POST /api/admin/workspace/allowance); it is a total, not a daily reset.",
        "Keep this file in step with wrangler.agents.jsonc. Secrets, set from stdin:",
        "OWNER_TOKEN  staging-only owner credential (~/.config/yonedarepo/staging.env)",
        "VAULT_KEY    64 hex characters, shared with yonedarepo-staging-platform",
        "The apps Worker's `https://*.yonedarepo.com/*` route would otherwise win: on one hostname a",
        "route takes precedence over a Custom Domain, and the most specific route pattern wins. The",
        "exact route keeps dev.yonedarepo.com here without touching the apps Worker (the same",
        "pattern production uses for www).",
        "Sandbox runs (runtime sandbox-cli-v1): one AgentSandbox Durable Object per attempt starts",
        "sandbox/Dockerfile (Claude Code + yoneda CLI) with Internet off; SandboxOutbound",
        "adds the provider key and the project token. Model requests go through the AI Gateway named",
        "in SANDBOX_AI_GATEWAY (custom providers custom-zai and custom-mimo; one-time setup in",
        "docs/runbook.md). The sandbox clones from SANDBOX_PLATFORM_ORIGIN."
      ],
      "secrets": [
        "OWNER_TOKEN",
        "VAULT_KEY"
      ],
      "health": "yonedarepo",
      "config": {
        "name": "{prefix}-agents",
        "main": "worker/agents-index.ts",
        "compatibility_date": "2026-10-07",
        "compatibility_flags": [
          "nodejs_compat"
        ],
        "limits": {
          "subrequests": 50000
        },
        "workers_dev": true,
        "preview_urls": false,
        "placement": {
          "mode": "targeted",
          "region": "aws:us-east-1"
        },
        "routes": [
          {
            "pattern": "dev.yonedarepo.com",
            "custom_domain": true
          },
          {
            "pattern": "https://dev.yonedarepo.com/*",
            "zone_name": "yonedarepo.com"
          }
        ],
        "observability": {
          "enabled": true
        },
        "assets": {
          "directory": "../frontend/dist",
          "binding": "ASSETS",
          "not_found_handling": "single-page-application",
          "run_worker_first": true
        },
        "vars": {
          "PUBLIC_APP_ORIGIN": "{origin}",
          "ARTIFACTS_NAMESPACE": "{prefix}",
          "CODEX_MODEL": "gpt-5.6-luna",
          "CLAUDE_MODEL": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
          "MIMO_MODEL": "mimo-v2.6-flash",
          "ZAI_MODEL": "glm-5.3-flash",
          "STARTER_REPO": "yoneda-website-starter",
          "SITE_ORIGIN": "https://{prefix}-sites.{subdomain}.workers.dev",
          "MANAGED_PROVIDER_KEYS": "secrets-store",
          "SANDBOX_PLATFORM_ORIGIN": "https://{prefix}-platform.{subdomain}.workers.dev",
          "SANDBOX_AI_GATEWAY": "{account_id}/{prefix}"
        },
        "services": [
          {
            "binding": "SELF",
            "service": "{prefix}-agents"
          },
          {
            "binding": "PLATFORM",
            "service": "{prefix}-platform"
          }
        ],
        "secrets_store_secrets": [
          {
            "binding": "MIMO_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "MiMo"
          },
          {
            "binding": "ZAI_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "ZAI"
          }
        ],
        "artifacts": [
          {
            "binding": "ARTIFACTS",
            "namespace": "{prefix}",
            "remote": true
          }
        ],
        "durable_objects": {
          "bindings": [
            {
              "name": "REPOSITORIES",
              "class_name": "RepositoryAuthority"
            },
            {
              "name": "LIVE",
              "class_name": "LiveRoom"
            },
            {
              "name": "EXECUTIONS",
              "class_name": "ExecutionContainer"
            },
            {
              "name": "SOURCES",
              "class_name": "SourceWorkspaceAuthority"
            },
            {
              "name": "WORKSPACES",
              "class_name": "WorkspaceAuthority",
              "script_name": "{prefix}-platform"
            },
            {
              "name": "AGENT_SANDBOX",
              "class_name": "AgentSandbox"
            }
          ]
        },
        "migrations": [
          {
            "tag": "v1",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "RepositoryAuthority",
              "LiveRoom",
              "ExecutionContainer",
              "SourceWorkspaceAuthority"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v2",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "AgentSandbox"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "containers": [
          {
            "class_name": "ExecutionContainer",
            "image": "./containers/Dockerfile",
            "image_build_context": "..",
            "max_instances": 6,
            "instance_type": "standard-1",
            "rollout_step_percentage": [
              100
            ],
            "constraints": {
              "regions": [
                "ENAM"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "class_name": "AgentSandbox",
            "scheduling_policy": "durable_object",
            "images": {
              "agent": {
                "dockerfile": "./sandbox/Dockerfile",
                "build_context": ".."
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "r2_buckets": [
          {
            "binding": "OBJECTS",
            "bucket_name": "{prefix}-agents-objects"
          }
        ],
        "d1_databases": [
          {
            "binding": "INDEX",
            "database_name": "{prefix}-agents-index",
            "migrations_dir": "migrations"
          }
        ],
        "queues": {
          "producers": [
            {
              "binding": "AGENT_QUEUE",
              "queue": "{prefix}-agents-agent"
            },
            {
              "binding": "CAPTURE_QUEUE",
              "queue": "{prefix}-agents-capture"
            },
            {
              "binding": "EVALUATE_QUEUE",
              "queue": "{prefix}-agents-evaluate"
            }
          ],
          "consumers": [
            {
              "queue": "{prefix}-agents-agent",
              "max_batch_size": 1,
              "max_retries": 3,
              "dead_letter_queue": "{prefix}-agents-dead-letter"
            },
            {
              "queue": "{prefix}-agents-capture",
              "max_batch_size": 1,
              "max_retries": 3,
              "dead_letter_queue": "{prefix}-agents-dead-letter"
            },
            {
              "queue": "{prefix}-agents-evaluate",
              "max_batch_size": 1,
              "max_retries": 3,
              "dead_letter_queue": "{prefix}-agents-dead-letter"
            }
          ]
        },
        "ratelimits": [
          {
            "name": "AUTH_LIMITER",
            "namespace_id": "{ratelimit}",
            "simple": {
              "limit": 30,
              "period": 60
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "sites",
      "file": "wrangler.staging-sites.jsonc",
      "notes": [
        "Staging website previews for the dev.yonedarepo.com stack: wrangler.sites.jsonc bound to the",
        "staging agent Worker and its bucket instead of production. workers.dev only; the agent",
        "Worker's SITE_ORIGIN points here."
      ],
      "secrets": [],
      "config": {
        "name": "{prefix}-sites",
        "main": "sites/index.ts",
        "compatibility_date": "2026-10-07",
        "compatibility_flags": [
          "nodejs_compat"
        ],
        "workers_dev": true,
        "preview_urls": false,
        "r2_buckets": [
          {
            "binding": "OBJECTS",
            "bucket_name": "{prefix}-agents-objects"
          }
        ],
        "services": [
          {
            "binding": "PLATFORM",
            "service": "{prefix}-agents"
          }
        ],
        "observability": {
          "enabled": true
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
